==History==
2024
*The Goblin Cage Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 5/8/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/8/2024)|August 2024 Update]].
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]], fixed a few bugs with the Goblin Cage's Evolution.
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Goblin Cage’s attack time interval to 1 second (from 1.1 seconds).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Goblin Brawler after death.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Evolved Goblin Brawler's hitpoints by 0.16%. It also made it so that [[Rune Giant]] would no longer be able to enchant troops if captured by Evolved Goblin Cage.
*On 29/9/2025, Evolved Goblin Cage no longer grabs [[Mega Knight]] mid-air.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)|Balance Update]] removed the Evolved Goblin Brawler's hitpoints boost.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Evolved Goblin Cage's number of cycles to 2 (from 1), increased its trapped DPS by 9%, and decreased its ability cooldown to 0.3 seconds (from 0.5 seconds)

