==Trivia==
*Goblins are small, grotesque, monstrous creatures that appear in the folklore of multiple European cultures. First attested in stories from the Middle Ages, they are ascribed conflicting abilities, temperaments, and appearances depending on the story and country of origin, ranging from mischievous household spirits to malicious, bestial thieves. They often have magical abilities similar to a fairy or demon, such as the ability to shapeshift. Similar creatures include [[Wikipedia:Duende|duendes]], [[Wikipedia:Kobold|kobolds]], [[Wikipedia:Leprechaun|leprechauns]], and [[Wikipedia:Ghoul|ghouls]].
**In the German and Dutch language setting of the game, the Goblin Cage's name translates to "Kobold Cage". In the Spanish, Italian, Russian, Arabic, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Goblin Cage's name translates to "Strongman's Cage", "Cage for Goblins", "Cage with Goblin", "Ghoul Cage", and "Leprechaun Cage" respectively.
**The Goblin Cage is 1 of 6 evolved [[cards]] associated with [[Goblins]], with the others being [[Mortar/Evolution|Mortar]], [[Dart Goblin/Evolution|Dart Goblin]], [[Goblin Giant/Evolution|Goblin Giant]], [[Goblin Barrel/Evolution|Goblin Barrel]], and [[Goblin Drill/Evolution|Goblin Drill]].
*The Evolved Goblin Brawler has a mohawk, similarly to the Goblin Brawler’s [[Star Points|Star Level 3 Skin]].
*The Evolved Goblin Cage is the cheapest 1-Cycle evolution, being 4 elixir.
*[[Chests|Gold Crates]] have an appearance similar to the Evolved Goblin Cage.
*When deployed, a voice can be heard exclaiming "''Goblin Cage!''", and when the Evolved Goblin Cage is destroyed, the Evolved Goblin Brawler yells "''Cage Rage!''".
**The Goblin Cage is the only evolved [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] to speak distinct words when on the field.
**The Goblin Brawler is 1 of 9 evolved [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Wizard/Evolution|Wizard]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A./Evolution|P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Hunter/Evolution|Hunter]], [[Executioner/Evolution|Executioner]], [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]], and [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]].
***Also, the Goblin Brawler is 1 of 6 evolved troops whose regular troop do not speak distinct words when on the field, the others being Bomber, Witch, Hunter, Executioner, and Mega Knight.
*The Evolved Goblin Brawler has a weight of 87.5 kilograms according to the Clash Royale August 2024 event calendar.
*The Goblin Cage's Evolution is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
*The Goblin Cage's Evolution was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/Sa0QOSJ5AVY?si=Hlcj6efCnFhxfDYe Clash Royale League 2024 Tournament], by a player called Mohamed Light.
*The Goblin Brawler evolved due to training inside of the cage, as seen in a [https://www.youtube.com/shorts/A5iYQSUkBrI short].

